
Visual enhancements:
Background image upload (stage floor plan)
Stage props/objects (rectangles, circles for furniture)

Advanced features:
Movement paths (draw arrows showing character blocking)
Multiple scenes/cues management
Keyboard shortcuts (Delete key to remove, arrow keys to nudge position)
Ruler/measurement tools
Character rotation with arrow keys (not just mouse)



Here are some ideas to modernize the page:

Visual Design:

Add a modern color scheme (darker toolbar, softer backgrounds)
Card-style UI with shadows and rounded corners for dropdowns
Better typography (system font stack: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI")
Icon buttons instead of text (with tooltips)
Smooth transitions (fade in/out for menus, scale for buttons)
Glass morphism effects for floating panels
Layout Improvements:

Sidebar instead of horizontal toolbar (more workspace)
Floating toolbar when character selected (near character)
Mini toolbar that follows selected character
Collapsible panels for config/file operations
Better Interactions:

Toast notifications instead of alert() dialogs
Context menu (right-click on character for actions)
Keyboard shortcuts panel (press ? to show)
Drag to pan canvas (with space bar or middle mouse)
Zoom controls (scroll to zoom, reset button)
Canvas Enhancements:

Grid background (subtle dots or lines)
Rulers along top and left edges
Minimap in corner showing full stage
Snap-to-grid option with visual feedback
Modern UI Components:

Replace alerts with toast notifications
Use range sliders instead of number inputs
Add command palette (Cmd/Ctrl+K to search actions)
Undo/redo history panel showing thumbnail previews
Theme toggle (light/dark mode)